	(text "Contact position j (A = 0 ... Z = 25) sits at j x 13.846 deg from the index mark, counter-clockwise seen from the\ncontact (front) side = mirror image of the drum's clockwise letter order seen from its pad side.\nColumn chain: IN - lower R4 | lower R3 - middle R4 | middle R3 - upper R4 | upper R3 - reflector - upper R2 |\nupper R1 - middle R2 | middle R1 - lower R2 | lower R1 - OUT.  Ribbons: 1:1, pin k to pin k."
